O6: the JDK of the Prebid Server Java build is a build argument (FAST Channels overlay on the guidance v1.4.0)

The guidance builds Prebid Server Java 3.43.0 with Corretto 21. Prebid Server Java 4.x needs Java 25 (Spring Boot 4,
Vert.x 5). ARG JDK (default 21, as shipped) selects the apk package and JAVA_HOME; the image build passes JDK=25 for
a stage with modules.demand.pbs_version 4.4.0, together with a docker-build-config.json for that release.

diff --git a/deployment/ecr/prebid-server/Dockerfile b/deployment/ecr/prebid-server/Dockerfile
--- a/deployment/ecr/prebid-server/Dockerfile
+++ b/deployment/ecr/prebid-server/Dockerfile
@@ -18,13 +18,15 @@
 
 # Build argument to control AMT bidder file inclusion
 ARG INCLUDE_AMT_BIDDER=false
+# Overlay O6 (FAST Channels): the Corretto major version (21 for Prebid Server Java 3.x, 25 for 4.x)
+ARG JDK=21
 
 # Install required dependencies
 RUN wget -O /etc/apk/keys/amazoncorretto.rsa.pub https://apk.corretto.aws/amazoncorretto.rsa.pub && \
     echo "https://apk.corretto.aws/" >> /etc/apk/repositories && \
     apk update && \
     apk add --no-cache \
-        amazon-corretto-21 \
+        amazon-corretto-${JDK} \
         maven=3.9.11-r0 \
         git \
         jq \
@@ -32,7 +34,7 @@
         bash
 
 # Set JAVA_HOME
-ENV JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-21-amazon-corretto
+ENV JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-${JDK}-amazon-corretto
 ENV PATH="${JAVA_HOME}/bin:${PATH}"
 
 # Create custom JRE
